# Body **`{"reservationIds":[]}`**. The DTO applies **`@Size(min = 1, max = 100)`** on **`reservationIds`**, so Spring MVC returns **400** **`VALIDATION_ERROR`** (`MethodArgumentNotValidException`) before **`AccountQueryService.batchGetReservations`** is invoked. **`InvalidBatchGetReservationsRequestException`** (**`INVALID_BATCH_GET_RESERVATIONS_REQUEST`**) is reserved for an empty deduplicated id list in the service layer, but an **`[]`** request cannot reach that path because **`min = 1`** fails first.
